  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/17ee53f0aa3cebaac16ad79ae2fa79e562336dde52fe9a4fd41bdb0c7ce4a2a3.png] \n\nGiven equation:** 289 + 17 × 12 ÷ 216 − 300 = 120**\n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **÷ and +**\n\n→ **289 ÷ 17** × 12 + 216 − 300 = 120\n\n→ **17 × 12** + 216 − 300 = 120\n\n→ **204 +**** 216** − 300 = 120\n\n→ 420 − 300 = 120\n\n→ 120 = 120 \n\n<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"&g",
